a.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/79558b2c-1e17-46be-99c0-c0b511c93a36.pdf"},{"symbol":"DHARIWAL","ticker":"DHARIWAL","company":"Dhariwalcorp Limited","event_type":"acquisition","quantum":"Rs 24.11 cr; ~9.2% of mcap","headline":"buys **three industrial plots at Salawas, Jodhpur, from its promoter-directors for Rs 24.11 crore** plus stamp duty, a related-party purchase approved at the 1 September AGM","amount_rs":"241100000","notability_pct":"9.24","marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DHARIWALCORP_14092026153346_Reg_30_1.pdf","mcap":254.8,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DHARIWALCORP_14092026153346_Reg_30_1.pdf"},{"symbol":"WHITEFORCE","ticker":"WHITEFORCE","company":"Happy Square Outsourcing Services Limited","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 5.02 cr; ~11.6% of mcap","headline":"wins a **one-year manpower-services work order from Hindustan Copper worth about Rs 5.02 crore** including taxes","amount_rs":"50247000","notability_pct":"11.64","marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/HAPPYSQUARE_14092026135122_General_Update_for_tenders-HCL.pdf","mcap":45.2,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/HAPPYSQUARE_14092026135122_General_Update_for_tenders-HCL.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**KEC International** — secures **new orders worth Rs 1,303 crore** across transmission projects in India, Saudi Arabia and the Americas and cables and conductors, lifting year-to-date order intake above Rs 7,600 crore _(~12.0% of mcap)_.","**Happy Square Outsourcing (WHITEFORCE)** — wins a **manpower-services work order from Hindustan Copper worth about Rs 5.02 crore** including taxes, running 13 September 2026 to 12 September 2027 _(~11.6% of mcap)_.","**De Neers Tools** — secures an order to **supply 16,500 tool kits to Renault** through its channel partners; value not disclosed."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Faalcon Concepts** — board approves a **rights issue of equity shares of up to Rs 22 crore**, with the price, entitlement ratio and record date still to be set _(~52.4% of mcap)_.","**Interactive Financial Services** — board approves the **draft letter of offer for a rights issue**, with the issue size, price and ratio still blank in the draft."],"equity_allotments":["**Cubical Financial Services** — allots a **second tranche of 5,11,00,000 new shares at Rs 2.50, Rs 12.78 crore**, to open-offer acquirers Manoj Agrawal and Amit Kumar Saraogi, each ending at 21.42% _(~30.1% of mcap)_.","**Shivalik Rasayan** — allots **2,82,000 new shares at Rs 250 (Rs 7.05 crore)** to five public investors and **9,47,990 new warrants at Rs 250 (Rs 23.70 crore)** to promoter Growel Remedies and public investors Bishnoi Exports and Ginnerup Capital ApS.","**Chandan Healthcare** — allots **5,99,998 shares at Rs 234 on converting warrants issued in February 2026**, Rs 14.04 crore in all, to five non-promoter holders led by Jeena Sikho Lifecare; 16,50,002 of their warrants remain _(~2.9% of mcap)_."],"m_and_a":["**Solar Industries India** — step-down Solar SA Investments signs definitive agreements to **buy all of JSE-listed Omnia Holdings in cash for about US$1.355 billion**, Rs 12,951 crore per the filing, subject to approvals _(~6.4% of mcap)_.","**Lemon Tree Hotels** — wholly owned Carnation Hotels signs a JV under which **RJ Corp subscribes 47,65,394 new shares for 49% of Arum Hotels**, the SPV building Aurika Shillong, leaving Carnation 51% with equal board seats.","**Cube Highways Trust** — signs a **binding offer to buy 100% of two Uttar Pradesh road SPVs**, Apco Chetak Ultraway and Apco Chetak Expressway, from Apco Infratech and Chetak Enterprises; consideration to be disclosed at definitive agreements.","**Bharat Heavy Electricals** — board approves a **further Rs 65 crore of equity in NTPC BHEL Power Projects**, its 50:50 JV with NTPC, which the filing says is mainly to settle urgent liabilities and keep it a going concern.","**Standard Capital Markets** — NCLT Ahmedabad on 9 September **approved its resolution plan for Bhagirath Construction Company** as successful applicant, effective that date; the filing does not state the plan value.","**Nephrocare Health Services** — its Philippine step-down subsidiary agrees to **buy a dialysis centre's assets in Plaridel, Bulacan, from Renal One Dialysis for PhP 67,200,000**, about INR 10.25 crore at the filing's rate.","**Waaree Renewable Technologies** — wholly owned Waaree Green Data Centers **incorporates Aurovault Data Centers as a 100% subsidiary** to build and run data centres, including hyperscale and AI-ready facilities.","**Satin Creditcare Network** — subsidiary Satin Growth Alternatives makes its AIF's first investment, **Rs 5 crore in NCDs and compulsorily convertible preference shares of Indic Wisdom**, a woman-founder-led maker of wood-pressed oils."],"capex_core":["**HFCL** — approves **about Rs 820 crore more capex** to add 4.60 mn fibre-km of optical fibre, 5.64 mn fibre-km of cable and 300 MT of preform a year, due by October 2028 _(~2.3% of mcap, our arithmetic)_.","**UNO Minda** — board approves a **3.3 mn-unit two-wheeler alloy-wheel plant at Kharkhoda (about Rs 155 crore)** and a **greenfield casting plant at Hosur (about Rs 510 crore)**, plus Rs 80 crore at subsidiary Uno Minda Kyoraku's Bengaluru plant.","**Dhariwalcorp** — buys **three industrial plots totalling 2,922.5 sq m at Salawas, Jodhpur, from promoter-directors Manish and Shakshi Dhariwal for Rs 24.11 crore** plus stamp duty, approved at the 1 September AGM _(~9.2% of mcap)_.","**ACME Solar Holdings** — commissions **Phase-I battery storage of 53.63 MW / 300 MWh** of a 300 MW / 1,581 MWh FDRE project in Bikaner, commercial operation from 16 September; its generation component is still being built.","**Elin Electronics** — **starts commercial production at its Bhiwadi, Rajasthan plant**, a Rs 5 crore investment funded from internal accruals _(~1.1% of mcap)_."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 4 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**CarTrade Tech** — OLX India launches **Elite Buyer for Businesses**, saying the programme now adds **more than 5,000 buyers a day** after crossing 100,000 sign-ups in July.","**TAC Infosec** — says it **added about 1,600 clients in July–August**, a monthly addition rate 37% above Q1 FY27, and that its Socify.ai product has reached 300 customers.","**Shreeji Shipping Global** — wins **exclusive rights to handle dry bulk cargo at Sanegaon jetty, Raigad**, with back-up land, from Indo Energy International for three years extendable to five, from 15 September; commercials not disclosed.","**Yash Highvoltage** — US subsidiary signs a **36-month sales-representation agreement with Ensales Electrical Associates** covering transformer bushings and utility approvals across 19 US states."],"distress_risk":["**Piramal Pharma** — the US FDA closes a 3–11 September inspection of its **Morpeth, UK facility with a Form-483 carrying 7 observations**, which the company says concern practices, procedures and documentation.","**Yatharth Hospital** — receives final **income-tax assessment orders demanding Rs 29.66 crore plus Rs 11.42 crore interest** for AY 2014-15 to 2024-25, with further demands on two subsidiaries; it will appeal and makes no provision."],"open_offers":["**Cubical Financial Services Ltd** — Manoj Agrawal open offer (3.77 cr shares) at Rs 2.5 vs CMP 6.51 (-61.6%); >25% acquisition (Reg 3(1)); **DO NOT TENDER - market pays more than the offer**; tender window not in PA (comes with DPS/LoF); mcap Rs 42 cr"],"other_notable":["**Emami** — board meets on **17 September to consider a buyback of equity shares**; size and price not yet disclosed.","**Oriana Power** — board approves **up to Rs 65 crore of equity in 74%-owned Oriana Usolar JV** for its EPC work, and up to Rs 50 crore and Rs 3 crore in solar-plant subsidiaries Dynospark and Voltonomy.","**Bodal Chemicals** — **denies a social-media report that it is merging with a private entity**, calling it fake and saying no amalgamation is under consideration."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","open_offers":"Open offers (PA)","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"label":"KEC","ticker":"KEC","company":"KEC International Ltd","isin":"INE389H01022","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/0db6bd02-c6f2-49a5-b7a5-214b50764904.pdf","mcap":10566.8},{"mcap":null},{"label":"DENEERS","ticker":"DENEERS","company":"De Neers Tools Limited","isin":"INE0JWV01011","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DENEERS_14092026172833_CoverLetterBusinessUpdateRenaultOrder.pdf","mcap":161.7}],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":[{"label":"FAALCON","ticker":"FAALCON","company":"Faalcon Concepts Ltd","isin":"INE0Q9W01015","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/8a48a623-f3c6-4bf3-8a64-4bef0d7a44a8.pdf","mcap":40.0},{"label":"IFINSER","ticker":"IFINSER","company":"Interactive Financial Services Ltd","isin":"INE064T01018","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/d15c37f3-21e5-4298-bc29-9d6a16d508fe.pdf","mcap":7.7}],"equity_allotments":[{"mcap":null},{"label":"SHIVALIK","ticker":"SHIVALIK","company":"Shivalik Rasayan Ltd","isin":"INE788J01021","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/985ca571-bd7f-4c4d-9d53-75a6c8165e2c.pdf","mcap":643.3},{"label":"CHANDAN","ticker":"CHANDAN","company":"Chandan Healthcare Limited","isin":"INE0B2N01016","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives